*  arb1.sno — EARN-4 gate witness (GOAL-RBP-EARN.md names this file; it did not exist until 2026-08-11e).
*  Minimal pair. IDENTICAL pattern; the ONLY difference is the subject.
*    T1 subject "abcabc" -> ARBNO succeeds with 2 instances.
*    T2 subject "abcab"  -> ARBNO must EXHAUST and peel back instances. SIGSEGVs at HEAD fc5b0754.
*  Mechanism (FINDING-2026-08-11e): ARBNO's 32-bit cursor write at [rsp+4] lands on the upper
*  half of a spine slot holding a 64-bit resume address once instances peel and the RSP-relative
*  distance is no longer the compile-time constant the write assumed.
*  ORACLE PROVENANCE: expected output transcribed from the pre-baked SPITBOL ref of
*  crosscheck/patterns/181_pat_arbno_defer_tail_stressors.ref (identical pattern + identical
*  subjects, its T1/T2). NOT independently regenerated -- rebake with sbl -b when x64 is present.
        P = SPAN("ab") "c"
        S1 = "abcabc"
        S2 = "abcab"
        S1 POS(0) ARBNO(*P) RPOS(0)     :S(A1)F(B1)
A1      OUTPUT = "T1 MATCH"             :(N1)
B1      OUTPUT = "T1 NOMATCH"
N1      S2 POS(0) ARBNO(*P) RPOS(0)     :S(A2)F(B2)
A2      OUTPUT = "T2 MATCH"             :(N2)
B2      OUTPUT = "T2 NOMATCH"
N2
END
